sequenceDiagram
    participant DeploySH as deploy.sh<br/>(Init Container)
    participant K8sAPI as OpenShift API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Operator as rhods-operator
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>9091/TCP HTTPS
    participant Components as RHODS Components<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant ClusterProm as Cluster Prometheus<br/>9091/TCP HTTPS
    participant BBE as Blackbox Exporter<br/>9114/TCP HTTPS
    participant AM as Alertmanager<br/>10443/TCP HTTPS
    participant PD as PagerDuty API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant DMS as Dead Man's Snitch<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant SMTP as SMTP Server

    Note over DeploySH,K8sAPI: Flow 1: Component Deployment

    DeploySH->>K8sAPI: Create namespaces<br/>(redhat-ods-applications,<br/>redhat-ods-monitoring, rhods-notebooks)<br/>Auth: SA Token
    DeploySH->>K8sAPI: Apply Dashboard CRDs<br/>(OdhApplication, OdhDocument,<br/>OdhQuickStart, OdhDashboardConfig)
    DeploySH->>K8sAPI: Create KfDef CRs<br/>(dashboard, nbc, modelmesh,<br/>dspo, notebooks, monitoring)
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: KfDef watch event
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Reconcile component manifests<br/>(from odh-manifests.tar.gz)
    DeploySH->>K8sAPI: Apply NetworkPolicies<br/>(operator, applications, monitoring)
    DeploySH->>K8sAPI: Apply RBAC / SCC bindings
    DeploySH->>K8sAPI: Deploy monitoring stack<br/>(Prometheus, Alertmanager,<br/>Blackbox Exporter + oauth-proxy)

    Note over Prom,SMTP: Flow 2: Monitoring Pipeline (Managed Service)

    loop Init Container polling (~38min max)
        Prom->>Components: Check readiness<br/>HTTP/8080 (no auth)
        Components-->>Prom: Ready / Not Ready
    end

    loop Scrape interval (30s)
        Prom->>Components: GET /metrics<br/>HTTP/8080 (no auth)
        Components-->>Prom: Metrics data
    end

    Prom->>ClusterProm: Federate metrics<br/>HTTPS/9091 TLS (service CA)<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (SA)
    ClusterProm-->>Prom: haproxy, controller_runtime,<br/>container metrics

    BBE->>Components: Health probes<br/>HTTPS/8443 + HTTP/8080<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    Components-->>BBE: Probe results

    Note over AM,SMTP: Alert Routing (Managed Service)

    Prom->>AM: Fire alert (burn rate / SLO breach)
    AM->>PD: Critical alerts<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Service Key
    AM->>DMS: Heartbeat<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: URL Secret
    AM->>SMTP: User notifications<br/>(PVC usage warnings)<br/>STARTTLS<br/>Auth: Username/Password
